  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad43bd934b591fe2cb6e443df01c7bb9, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hey young human
  - It's nice to see a young soul in such a long time
  - Anyways...
  - You see...
  - I always come to this island on my weekend...
  - To spend some time here and chill
  - But I forgot to check the leakages on my boat...
  - And thank god that boat broke down right when I arrived on this island
  - But ever since then...
  - I couldn't leave due to the broken boat...
  - I have the raw materials and all but...
  - I don't know how to fix the boat so...
  - If you know how to fix the boat...
  - Fix it for me.
